<h3><font color="red">Essay Thesis Strength Dataset</font></h3>


<ul>
<li><a href="http://www.hlt.utdallas.edu/~zixuan/EssayScoring/ThesisStrength/ThesisStrengthDataset.zip">Essays and Annotations</a> Includes Thesis Strength scores, attributes of thesis statement, thesis statement as well as the raw text. Specifically, ".ann" files are the annotations. For example, TSNO1516.ann is the annotation of TSNO1516.
</li>
</ul>

